# Sweep artefacts: 26 residual checkpoints, of which ten are results the report
# quotes and sixteen are points on a validation curve.  manifest.json carries
# every one of them with its SHA-256, its bound and its validation loss, so a
# reader can tell whether the ten in the repository are the ten that were run.
*.pt
!surrogate.pt
!residual_seed0.pt
!residual_seed1.pt
!residual_seed2.pt
!residual_seed0_b015.pt
!residual_seed1_b015.pt
!residual_seed2_b015.pt
!residual_seed0_b040.pt
!residual_seed1_b040.pt
!residual_seed2_b040.pt
